  "details": "Hello! I'm not too-too sure if this is a bug or not so I hope this is the right spot to post it.\nDescription of the bug: When playing with a certain friend, we'll be randomly muted for everyone. We'll both be exploring a world together and then we'll have a muted mic icon on the bottom-ish left as if I had my mute on. This only happens when me and this friend are in a world together. No other friend triggers this. We either have to wait awhile, restart our games, or I can mess with my mic settings for a bit (which only I can do for some reason). The mute persists until either about 15-20 minutes passes or one of the other options. Sometimes it doesn't go away either. It also sticks if we go to other worlds alone.\nSteps to reproduce (how did you encounter the bug?): I'm not quite sure. The only condition I've noticed is us being in a room together, nothing else. Even if we're doing nothing.",
